#: templates/license.php:33
msgid ""
"The license key itself is entered through the native Freemius dialog (same "
"as on the Extensions screen). This page only points you to it — no separate "
"key handling here."
msgstr ""
"Der Lizenzschlüssel selbst wird über den nativen Freemius-Dialog eingegeben "
