#: src/pixvisualize/edit.js:743
msgid ""
"Paste <svg viewBox=\"…\">…</svg> only: XML prolog, DOCTYPE, metadata and "
"width/height are removed automatically. Use fill=\"currentColor\" so the "
"icon inherits Handle Arrows Color. Without an SVG, the Circle style is used."
